  clock: 10  # 6f13
  nonce: 6f13  # 6f13
  message: "B2 LANDED (PR #1559, merge c5561d4a93; status unchanged, campaign continues). ELIXIR migrated: the clauses of one module/name/arity fold into ONE function/macro node (Erlang shape). Name stays M.f (call resolution, narrow_by_arity, behaviour/protocol dispatch, framework callbacks, routes key on it); arity in meta.parameters; span first clause start to last clause end; defaults merged (def f(a, b \\\\ 1) is one f/2 node reachable at arity 1); clauses split by another def still fold; CC aggregated as Erlang. stable_id = overload_arity.declared_arity_stable_id(qualified_name=M.f, arity from meta); defstruct fields same formula. Floor->producer only: every previously producer-computed elixir id (callbacks, protocol heads, modules, routes: 151 on phoenix/lib, 1,470 on plausible) is byte-identical, so no scheme bump. Baseline: elixir removed from floor_and_null and sibling_deletion_moves (now 37 langs, 63 floor / 40 null). EVIDENCE on dev c5561d4a93: delete-an-earlier-sibling repro via hypergumbo run on lib/demo.ex (delete greet/3 and the first greet/1 clause) -> 6/6 surviving function/macro/field ids unchanged, 0 null. stable_id_stats.floor_abstained: phoenix/lib 678 -> 0, plausible 1,943 -> 4 (the 4 are not elixir). Nodes: phoenix/lib 2,231 -> 1,837, plausible 13,916 -> 12,637 (visible output change, CHANGELOG'd). Ledger: scratchpad fixes/tusad/TUSAD_PLAN.md."  # 6f13
