  message: "B5 LANDED (PR #1563, merge 9217879af6; status unchanged). Migrated to overload_arity.declared_arity_stable_id with typed parameters + scope chain: julia (functions/macros: positional params ::T, defaults, splats, keyword params excluded; module chain; abstract/const too), cuda (C-family params + namespace/class chain), glsl (functions; uniforms/in/out/varying/attribute arity-less), fortran (dummy args typed from declarations, unit chain; programs and type components too), cpp pure-virtual declarations (meta.parameters, decorators abstract,virtual). Shared helpers in core analyze/c_family (c_family_parameter_list/c_family_parameters moved from cpp.py byte-identically, c_family_scope_chain). Julia 'where' methods emitted no symbol before; now emitted. Floor/null -> producer only: producer ids byte-identical on fixtures + corpus sample, node/edge sets identical. Baseline 23 langs 34 floor / 24 null / 26 deletion failures -> 18 langs 28 floor / 16 null / 23. EVIDENCE on dev 9217879af6, delete-an-earlier-sibling via hypergumbo run (per-symbol match, not name-keyed): julia 2/2, cuda 2/2, glsl 2/2, fortran 3/3 survivors same id, 0 null; cpp 5/6 (both Box::find pure virtuals same; run(int) definition moves = scheme batch). Corpus floor/null all kinds -> 0: cuda 134+107 null (40 files), glsl 157+10 null (40), fortran 31 (25), julia 6 (1), C++ pure-virtual sample 187+28 abstained (40). Also fixed test_meta_key_coherence live-tree failure on dev (lean/tlaplus/wolfram post-hoc Symbol.meta writes). SCHEME BATCH: hlsl, cpp definitions, nim, ada, pascal, sql fixed + tested in scratchpad fixes/tusad/b5/scheme-bump.patch (all six pass the deletion check with it; zero-parameter ids unchanged; churn hlsl 25/25, cpp 320/417, ada 137/149, pascal 60/82 on samples). Ledger: scratchpad fixes/tusad/TUSAD_PLAN.md."  # 913b
