  message: "B6 LANDED (PR #1565, merge f5b3e71949; status unchanged). Migrated to the ADR-0035 producer formula with FULL scope chains: proto rpc methods + messages (package + every enclosing message/service; qualified_name now full chain, demo.A.B.Inner), thrift functions/typedefs/consts, capnp methods/consts, gdscript functions/signals, zig functions/methods/fields/unions/error sets/tests, qml (element chain by brace depth, Type#id labels), nix (attribute-path chain, let: marker), scala object/given, kotlin object, csharp property, swift computed property + subscript (param types), php field, dart constructor/getter/setter/mixin/extension. Floor/null -> producer only: producer ids byte-identical on gate fixtures + corpus sample (13 languages, up to 40 files each + 47 envoy api protos). Baseline 18 langs 28 floor / 16 null / 23 deletion failures -> 5 langs 10 floor / 2 null / 16 (B7 languages left). EVIDENCE on dev f5b3e71949, delete-an-earlier-sibling via hypergumbo run, per-symbol (kind,name,line,col) match: proto 3/3, thrift 3/3, capnp 3/3, scala 11/11, kotlin 6/6, csharp 5/5, swift 6/6, php 4/4, dart 6/6, zig 4/4, gdscript 3/3, qml 3/3, nix 3/3 survivors same id, 0 null. Corpus floor/null all kinds -> 0 for every language except proto 49 null (grpc-linker interface stand-ins, INV-fufij) and swift 1 floor (manifest_targets binary). Scheme-bump: no patch; analogue filed as INV-fabih-nusus-sozad-zozor-sosiz-fazoh-mazoh-ponat (scala/kotlin/csharp/swift members of nested same-name owners hash the nearest owner and move). Also filed INV-tazur-firun-lafoj-diziv-mopir-tasin-susof-mudus (smart-test git-rm'd test file -> 0 tests collected, green). Ledger: scratchpad fixes/tusad/TUSAD_PLAN.md."  # 1478
