  message: "B7 LANDED (PR #1566, merge 4c213ee87c; status unchanged). Migrated: jupyter (function), llvm_ir (function, declaration), wgsl (function, uniform, storage), cobol (program, section, paragraph, data), circom (function). jupyter: each def takes the Python producer formula, now one helper shared with py.py (py.python_callable_stable_id), file-anchored, enclosing class/function chain; methods were emitted twice (Class.m + bare-name duplicate from ast.walk) -> once (visible: 40-notebook sample 89 -> 69 function nodes, CHANGELOG'd). llvm_ir: typed params in meta.parameters + declared_arity_stable_id. wgsl: compute_stable_id / declared_arity_stable_id with the template branch (#ifdef/#else, #decl, #define(...)) as scope chain; ROOT CAUSE of corpus nulls = whisper.cpp shader templates defining the same function in two branches; entry points keep make_entry_stable_id. cobol: declared_arity_stable_id over program chain (nesting from END PROGRAM; grammar emits programs as siblings) + section / level-number group chain. circom: compute_stable_id; also fixed modifiers=None on intermediate signals, which crashed hypergumbo run on any circomlib checkout. Floor/null -> producer only: prior producer ids byte-identical (gate fixtures + corpus sample). Baseline: 5 langs 10 floor / 2 null, 16 deletion failures -> floor_and_null EMPTY, 15 deletion failures (jupyter removed; the 15 are all B8/scheme languages). Also: overload_arity passes file_stable_id= (value-identical; WI-bokab lint had failed since B1, unselected). EVIDENCE on dev 4c213ee87c, delete-an-earlier-sibling via hypergumbo run --include-docs, per-symbol (kind,name,line,col) match, gate fixture + richer file per language: jupyter 2/2 + 9/9, llvm_ir 2/2 + 4/4, wgsl 2/2 + 7/7, cobol 1/1 + 17/17, circom 4/4 + 5/5 survivors same id, 0 moved, 0 null. Corpus floor/null ALL kinds before -> after: jupyter 40 floor + 38 null -> 0 (40 notebooks); wgsl fn 6+56 null, storage 35+2, uniform 12+5 -> 0 (22 whisper.cpp files); circom fn 22 floor -> 0 (59 circomlib files); llvm_ir 1 fn + 1 decl floor -> 0 (the only .ll); cobol hand file data 4+4 null, program 2 -> 0 (no corpus cobol). SCHEME-BUMP PATCH (not merged): ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/tusad/b7-scheme-bump.patch (git apply --check OK on 4c213ee87c): circom templates (compute_stable_id) + signals/main (template-scoped declared_arity_stable_id; 196/492 corpus signals share a name in their file, so table ids occ-split and move when an earlier template is deleted), jupyter classes (Python class formula), wgsl struct/variable (template-branch scope). Churn on samples: circom class 124/124 + variable 492/492, jupyter class 11/11, wgsl struct 15/15. Ledger: scratchpad fixes/tusad/TUSAD_PLAN.md."  # 579f
