  message: "B8a LANDED (PR #1570, merge b4a783a901; status unchanged, campaign continues). (1) INV-fufij + every non-analyzer mint: one shared helper, overload_arity.scoped_stable_id (declared_arity_stable_id over a scope chain held as a list) and its wrapper pass_minted_stable_id (chain led by the minting pass); grpc-linker services/servicers/stubs (scope: framework role + proto package), view-template templates and manifest_targets build targets mint through it (INV-fufij set satisfied). A static scan in the floor gate fails any language-bearing Symbol(...) minted in core / backends / manifest_targets without a stable_id (19 mints seen, 6 exempt with reasons). (2) Gate: floor_and_null now counts EVERY kind (folded into the existing section, which was empty; no second census), pipeline run with include_docs, deletion survivors matched by (kind, name, line, col) for every kind, +34 fixtures (doc/config/build languages) and extra files reaching the linker/pass mints. Migrated floor->producer with scope chains: dockerfile (stage), make (conditional branch), cmake (enclosing block), css (at-rules + rule selector), toml/json entries, ansible (play), android xml (full name), bash alias, latex (sections), just (attributes as decorators, parameters to meta.parameters), handlebars (open blocks), graphql non-table kinds, hcl (provider alias), vhdl (entity/architecture), mermaid (diagram), blade, gnuplot plot (plotted text), erlang record, r source. Table kinds keep their table formulas. (3) Julia emits function Base.show(...), Base.length(x) = ..., and zero-method function f end (decorator \"generic\"). Byte-identity: 24,079 + 4,761 corpus ids and 1,064 gate-fixture ids unchanged (only solidity differs, which varies with the checkout path on dev too). EVIDENCE on dev b4a783a901: live hypergumbo run --include-docs delete-an-earlier-sibling repro over 26 files (per-symbol (kind,name,line,col) match) -> 87/87 survivors same id, 0 null, incl. grpc interface 2/2, python grpc class/function 4/4, view template 1/1, Package.swift binary 1/1. Corpus floor/null ALL kinds, ALL languages: 333 -> 0 (24,412-node code sample), 1,083 -> 0 (5,844-node config/doc sample), 4 -> 0 (verilog/vhdl/kdl/smithy/sparql/robot/twig hand sample). Gate: floor_and_null empty over every kind; sibling_deletion_moves 15 -> 29 (14 added = what the wider measurement finds: the doc family hashes line numbers in make_doc_stable_id, bibtex's stable_id is its node id). SCHEME PATCH: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/tusad/b8a-scheme-bump.patch (git apply --check OK on b4a783a901): make_doc_stable_id drops the span and takes a scope chain (ini setting <- section, kdl node <- parents), rst hashes titles/directives not ordinals, bibtex canonical; 15 languages leave the deletion list (astro bibtex gitignore ini kdl markdown pony properties puppet requirements robot rst scss sparql svelte); churn 2,392/5,844 ids on the config sample (every doc-family id). Stack: b5 patch no longer applies on the tip (baseline + overload_arity + test_overload_arity conflicts, additive); rebased copy b5-scheme-bump.rebased-on-b4a783a901.patch, then b7 applies cleanly, then b8a needs b8a-scheme-bump.stacked-after-b5r-b7.patch (baseline-list hunk); stacked gate: census empty, deletion list = bash purescript racket scheme solidity twig v vue. Filed out-of-campaign: INV-narib-botiz-kipim-nakug-vozop-pizop-labur-joluv. Ledger: scratchpad fixes/tusad/TUSAD_PLAN.md."  # b50e
